"content_id": "908834",
"reference_id": 6413,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "母示，母示族",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "母示母示族",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>母示，母示族</h1><p>米拉利的兒子、利未的孫子，也是抹利的兄弟（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02006019\" data-end-ref=\"02006019\">出6:19</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04003020\" data-end-ref=\"04003020\">民3:20</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13006019\" data-end-ref=\"13006047\">代上6:19</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13006019\" data-end-ref=\"13006047\">47</data>）。他是末力、以得和耶利摩的父親（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13023021\" data-end-ref=\"13023023\">代上23:21–23</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13024026\" data-end-ref=\"13024030\">24:26</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13024026\" data-end-ref=\"13024030\">30</data>），是抹利族的祖先（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04003033\" data-end-ref=\"04003033\">民3:33</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04026058\" data-end-ref=\"04026058\">26:58</data>）。</p>",
